      "Logo displayed on signage at your designated hole",
      "Hand out food, drinks, or giveaways at a hole",
      "Complimentary entry for 1 foursome (4 players)",
    ],
    href: "/registration/sponsor?tier=Premium+Adopt-A-Hole+%E2%80%94+Contest+Holes+%E2%80%94+%241%2C750",
  },
  {
    name: "Adopt-a-Hole Sponsor",
    badge: "9 left",
    badgeTone: "neutral",
    price: "$1,500",
    sub: "Includes 4 golfers",
    benefits: [
